Zandatsu (22/11, Fase 4B Mali): ativa AFRC (VK_EXT_image_compression_control) nos render targets de cor
em GPUs Mali Valhall/Immortalis que suportam a extensao (ex.: Mali-G615/G710/G720).
- cvar swordman_renut_afrc = auto|on|off (off por padrao; on para testar em Mali-G615/G715/G720).

--- a/app/thirdparty/plume/plume_render_interface_types.h
+++ b/app/thirdparty/plume/plume_render_interface_types.h
@@ -1818,6 +1818,7 @@
         // Textures. SwordMan (Android): BC formats sampled natively (Mali has none; Renut decodes them then).
         bool textureCompressionBC = false;
         bool textureCompressionASTC_LDR = false;
+        bool imageCompressionControl = false;  // Zandatsu (renut/0051): VK_EXT_image_compression_control (AFRC na Mali Valhall)
 
         // Descriptor sets. SwordMan (Android): Mali-G57 (r40) binds 7, Renut's draws use 8 unless compacted.
         uint32_t maxBoundDescriptorSets = 8;
